{"source_paper_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_010","section":"S01","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","items":[{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_010|S01|TF|001","full_original_stem":"每天早上烱瑩校長都會站在門口迎接大家，如果太陽從他的前方升起，而影子落下的方位會指向西方。","answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[66.5,96.37,102.5,108.37]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_010|S01|TF|002","full_original_stem":"樂活時間時，修言可能在操場的天空中同時看見太陽和月亮。","answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[66.5,150.25,102.5,162.25]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_010|S01|TF|003","full_original_stem":"沛樂從一百公尺跑道的起點慢慢向國旗杆靠近，會發現旗杆頂端的高度角沒有明顯改變。","answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[66.5,186.13,102.5,198.13]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_010|S01|TF|004","full_original_stem":"振赫發現利用拳頭數測量高度角，簡單、方便又精準。","answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[66.5,239.89,102.5,251.89]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_010|S01|TF|005","full_original_stem":"冠樺正要撿拾掉進生態池的樂樂棒球時，會發現小丑魚與溪蟹正在池底棲息。","answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[66.5,275.92,102.5,287.92]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_010|S01|TF|006","full_original_stem":"一旁的恩瑞看見布袋蓮跟樂樂棒球同時在池面上漂浮著，是因為其葉柄裡具有通氣組織。","answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[66.5,329.68,102.5,341.68]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_010|S01|TF|007","full_original_stem":"在菀真的水域紀錄表中，有觀察到福壽螺及蝌蚪，她去拜訪的水域環境有可能是水田。","answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[66.5,383.56,102.5,395.56]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_010|S01|TF|008","full_original_stem":"育揚到小琉球進行浮潛，會看見許多珊瑚礁還有海龜，可以就近觀察、輕輕觸碰牠們。","answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[66.5,437.44,102.5,449.44]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_010|S01|TF|009","full_original_stem":"根據國際拉姆薩濕地公約的定義，無論是天然或人為，只要水深低潮時不超過六公尺，都屬於濕地水域。","answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[66.5,491.34,102.5,503.34]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_010|S01|TF|010","full_original_stem":"為了保護水生生物，人類應該不過度捕撈，讓生態資源能永續繁衍。","answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[66.5,545.1,102.5,557.1]}]}
